<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 05:10:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>IMC Trading 的实习广告失火，显示出对量化工作的热潮</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/imc-trading-s-internship-ad-misfire-shows-rush-for-quant-jobs</link><description>一家全球贸易公司的实习机会已经变得非常热门，以至于人们几乎不需要任何信息就可以申请。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/imc-trading-s-internship-ad-misfire-shows-rush-for-quant-jobs'&gt;IMC Trading 的实习广告失火，显示出对量化工作的热潮&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：IMC Trading’s Internship Ad Misfire Shows Rush for Quant Jobs&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/imc-trading-s-internship-ad-misfire-shows-rush-for-quant-jobs</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 04:45:48 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>台湾 ETF 教父 Julian Liu 谈市场势头</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/taiwan-s-etf-godfather-julian-liu-on-market-momentum-video</link><description>元大证券投资信托基金董事长刘朱利安讨论了台湾 ETF 市场和 2027 年的下一个催化剂。他在彭博社的 ETF IQ Asia 上发表了独家演讲。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/taiwan-s-etf-godfather-julian-liu-on-market-momentum-video'&gt;台湾 ETF 教父 Julian Liu 谈市场势头&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Taiwan's ETF Godfather Julian Liu on Market Momentum&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/taiwan-s-etf-godfather-julian-liu-on-market-momentum-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 04:57:17 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>中国内阁在罕见的午间声明中强调市场支持</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/china-s-cabinet-stresses-market-support-in-midday-release</link><description>中国国务院在罕见的午间会议上重申了对资本市场的支持，强调了所谓国家队的作用，并承诺推出更多稳定股市的政策。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/china-s-cabinet-stresses-market-support-in-midday-release'&gt;中国内阁在罕见的午间声明中强调市场支持&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：China’s Cabinet Stresses Market Support in Rare Midday Statement&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/china-s-cabinet-stresses-market-support-in-midday-release</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 05:00:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks Extend Recovery on AI Trade, Treasuries Dip: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>马来西亚称如果亚航财务困境恶化可能会进行干预</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/malaysia-says-may-intervene-if-airasia-s-financial-woes-worsen</link><description>第二财政部长阿米尔·哈姆扎·阿齐赞表示，如果亚洲航空集团有限公司的财务困难恶化，马来西亚可能会考虑介入支持该公司，因为政府寻求保护国内航空连通性。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/malaysia-says-may-intervene-if-airasia-s-financial-woes-worsen'&gt;马来西亚称如果亚航财务困境恶化可能会进行干预&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Malaysia Says May Intervene If AirAsia’s Struggles Worsen&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/malaysia-says-may-intervene-if-airasia-s-financial-woes-worsen</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:22:52 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>